WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Ten past nine.

2
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:04.960
A girl called Maya lets
herself into her house.

3
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:08.820
"The hall light was off, though
she was sure she had left it on."

4
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:13.480
She stands on the mat, the door
open behind her, and listens.

5
00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.230
Now search the passage for afraid.

6
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.470
Or scared.

7
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.760
Or frightened.

8
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:19.810
Nothing.

9
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.500
Yet by the end, you're sure she is.

10
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.350
How can you know what the text never says?

11
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:30.570
In this mission, you'll learn to tell what
a text states from what it only suggests.

12
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:32.710
Is the dark hallway proof enough?

13
00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.650
Or can you only know what
the text says outright?

14
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.070
You'll test both.

15
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.610
Your mission: work out
how you know she's afraid.
